/* Crash reporting */
"Crash reports and rare errors go to the FX Steam Launcher developers (Sentry). No personal data." = "崩溃报告和偶发错误会发送给 FX Steam Launcher 开发者（Sentry）。不含个人数据。";
"Crash reports of the launcher and the VM process: crash reason, stack traces, loaded libraries." = "启动器和虚拟机进程的崩溃报告：崩溃原因、堆栈、已加载库。";
"A few errors: guest GPU context lost, shader pipeline compile failures (with an excerpt of the failing Metal shader source), libkrun panics, failed disk creation or first-start setup, VM stopped unexpectedly or killed (with the Mac's memory use), SteamOS not responding." = "少量错误：客户机 GPU 上下文丢失、着色器管线编译失败（附失败 Metal 着色器源码片段）、libkrun panic、磁盘创建或首次启动设置失败、虚拟机意外停止或被杀（附 Mac 内存占用）、SteamOS 无响应。";
"The launcher's last ~200 log lines (launcher, MoltenVK, libkrun and virglrenderer messages; home folder paths shortened to ~) and the boot stages." = "启动器最近约 200 行日志（启动器、MoltenVK、libkrun 和 virglrenderer 消息；家目录路径缩写为 ~）及启动阶段。";
"Versions and setup: app, macOS, libkrun/virglrenderer/MoltenVK builds, kernel, SteamOS build, Mac model, GPU, VM CPUs/RAM/display mode, game App IDs." = "版本与配置：应用、macOS、libkrun/virglrenderer/MoltenVK 构建、内核、SteamOS 构建、Mac 机型、GPU、虚拟机 CPU/内存/显示模式、游戏 App ID。";
"A random install ID (not linked to you) to count affected Macs." = "随机安装 ID（与你无关），用于统计受影响的 Mac 数量。";
"Never: your name, user or computer name, IP address, Steam account, game titles, files, or the SteamOS console." = "绝不包含：你的姓名、用户名或电脑名、IP 地址、Steam 账号、游戏标题、文件、SteamOS 控制台。";
"Reports go to the developers' own Sentry server (sentry.fxgam.es). Turn this off any time in Settings > General, or for one run with --no-crash-reports / STEAMAC_SENTRY=0." = "报告发送到开发者自己的 Sentry 服务器（sentry.fxgam.es）。可随时在“设置 > 通用”中关闭，或单次用 --no-crash-reports / STEAMAC_SENTRY=0 关闭。";

