"Always included: app, macOS and library versions, Mac model, GPU, disk sizes and the launcher settings (never passwords or Keychain items)." = "始终包含：应用、macOS 和库版本、Mac 机型、GPU、磁盘大小和启动器设置（绝不含密码或钥匙串内容）。";
"Crash reports are off. Sending this report does not turn them on: only this report is sent." = "崩溃报告已关闭。发送此报告不会将其打开：仅发送这一份报告。";
