"Games currently have %.1f GiB. Enter a larger home capacity in GiB (up to 4096). This never shrinks or deletes your disk. APFS / Mac OS Extended use space only as SteamOS writes; exFAT takes the full added size immediately and needs that much free space. SteamOS will shut down normally, the image will be enlarged while it is stopped, then restart." = "游戏当前占用 %.1f GiB。请输入更大的 home 容量（GiB，上限 4096）。此操作从不缩小或删除磁盘。APFS / Mac OS 扩展格式按 SteamOS 实际写入占用空间；exFAT 会立即占用全部新增空间，需要等量空闲空间。SteamOS 将正常关机，停止期间扩展映像，然后重启。";
"Games currently have %.1f GiB. Enter a larger home capacity in GiB (up to 4096). This never shrinks or deletes your disk. APFS / Mac OS Extended use space only as SteamOS writes; exFAT takes the full added size immediately and needs that much free space. SteamOS must be stopped. The partition and filesystem grow on its next boot." = "游戏当前占用 %.1f GiB。请输入更大的 home 容量（GiB，上限 4096）。此操作从不缩小或删除磁盘。APFS / Mac OS 扩展格式按 SteamOS 实际写入占用空间；exFAT 会立即占用全部新增空间，需要等量空闲空间。SteamOS 必须处于停止状态，分区和文件系统将在下次启动时扩容。";
